ENGLISH

The contents of this repository are published for demonstration and
documentation purposes only, to illustrate the author's design work.

No licence of use is granted. In particular, the following are not
permitted, in whole or in part:

  - use for personal, academic or commercial purposes;
  - reproduction, copying or redistribution;
  - modification and creation of derivative works;
  - use for training machine learning systems or language models.

Consultation and citation with explicit attribution to the author are
permitted, within the limits of fair reporting and criticism.

For usage requests, consulting or collaboration, please contact the
author.
